Version: beta-v1.1.6
Changelog: |
  This release expands Lua downloads with configurable provider selection,
  HubcapDB integration, improved store-page feedback, and a modular Accela
  post-processing pipeline.

  Highlights:
  - Added a browser injection script that displays the compiled SLSsteam version
    in Steam's top navigation bar through the RemoveLua injection flow.
  - Added Lua download provider selection and configurable provider ordering.
  - Added HubcapDB as a Lua download provider with API-key configuration and
    download session tracking.
  - Added HubcapKey support to the configuration and store-page injection flow.
  - Added skeleton loading states, asynchronous injection, improved loading
    bars, and provider-specific download tracking to the store page.
  - Prevented duplicate API authentication keys from being stored during
    updateApiAuth.
  - Added YAML escaping for API authentication keys before configuration writes.
  - Added modular Accela manifest parsing and validation.
  - Added Steam installation path detection and directory management for Accela.
  - Added Accela post-processing for ACF writing and manifest management.
  - Added ZIP validation, assembly, and extraction modules for Accela downloads.
  - Separated Accela workflow concerns into dedicated, maintainable C++ modules.

DownloadUrl: https://github.com/TropicalFrog3/SLSsteam_n_ACCELA/releases/download/${version}/SLSsteam-n-ACCELA.zip
